      "content": "That makes sense. My main concern is how the board will view the \"encroachment\" aspect specifically. Since the utility easement is technically an intrusion onto the property line, I'm worried they'll see it as a fundamental breach of the zoning boundary rather than just a minor technicality. Do you have any specific legal arguments or precedents for when an encroachment should be considered negligible in a rezoning context?",
